{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1000_043nor", "source_sha256": "7fd8073b37440aa634f2688ae1b18874b91ca9d85dc45e68ad7a2701c9e601d1", "ja": "そっかー。じゃあやっぱり、\nたまには会いたくなったりしない？", "zh": "这样啊——那么，果然还是会偶尔想见面吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "060d05c9abe5d02851b1b2c8efa4bee1dc5c4d4222fee5f2880da5a1d9136c5c", "ja": "平気さー。そもそも自分は、トップアイドルに\nなるまで地元には帰らないって決めてるからね。", "zh": "没事啦——。说到底，我已经决定了，在成为顶尖偶像之前都不回老家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "5d9facdc4bec7de7296f5a7adc4049149dc4b45f6327d26a854e3be39e8ff783", "ja": "それに、こっちにも家族はいるし。劇場のみんなもね。\nだから寂しくなんかないぞ！", "zh": "而且，我在这边也有家人。剧场里的大家也是。所以我一点都不寂寞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "be6a6a608bf7f952ba21717b3f42f841541b42e1ab345d12e0fcf517fe7a8275", "ja": "はぁ～、響はすごいなー。しっかりしてて料理も上手で\n家族の面倒も見られて。アタシももっと見習わないと！", "zh": "哈啊～，响真厉害啊。又可靠，做饭也很拿手，还能照顾家人。我也得多向你学习才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "dab370b3e5a576c0abe40eabb30d5f075a819e39010e7cb68a0230d8a7a98d40", "ja": "えへへ、自分、カンペキだからね！\n困ったことがあったら、いつでも頼ってよねっ。", "zh": "嘿嘿，因为我可是完美的嘛！\n遇到什么困难，随时都可以来找我哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "e1048d2a1a11633998132bf88f7570efc95b745c3bfd1cf13dd4fae7ea069e2f", "ja": "響ねーねー……\n杏奈、宿題……困ってます……。", "zh": "响姐姐……\n杏奈遇到作业……难题了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "eb4d6fd39c5a4c51f900a934b20e1ecb92abbcb8e830cdd928c1ebea9bafc973", "ja": "……！　任せて、響ねーねーがなんでも\n教えてあげる！！", "zh": "……！交给我吧，响姐姐什么都会教你的！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1007_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3bb499db12a2fad33b8ae9dbad595382aa2abaf926eba1bc799bf4e77cd28271", "ja": "響、杏奈の勉強を見てくれるのもいいんだけど……\nちょっと仕事の話もいいかな？", "zh": "响，帮杏奈学习当然好，不过……\n能不能也聊一下工作的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "77b7e2288862d766cddab00ebda59aecf4c99ef92df93e197fa359215daa4e23", "ja": "仕事？　あ、今度の公演の話？", "zh": "工作？啊，是下次公演的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b776a95f7efeee83e1d36d2d160be759b2b6d7e374c6d22491536a29055f3149", "ja": "そう。今度の響のセンター公演だけど……", "zh": "对。是下次响的Center公演，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d6c00be2f1b8dd15ae51618bb9bebbc68cb38d8468ed9f2491a76e52b24b2269", "ja": "『Next Life』をやらないか？", "zh": "要不要表演《Next Life》？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "4a9820f176e2cd1311499ba7c073e347d7936efbd859cf4af2a9c00e565e5073", "ja": "え……っ、『Next Life』！？", "zh": "诶……《Next Life》！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "e7a9579535e50f52923cfbd19dfbaead01990ae26d6dc2366919c4fdc7183552", "ja": "『Next Life』って、たしか響が前に出してた、\nすっごくカッコいい曲だよね？", "zh": "『Next Life』我记得是响以前发行的、\n特别帅气的一首歌对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "8153faddbaf2453a7cd72dd5e6b2b174ef69d140ec47c600b8c8cf46fbcdd8c4", "ja": "リリースが39プロジェクトの前だから、のり子達は\nよく知らないかもね。でも、今も人気があるのよ。", "zh": "因为是在39项目之前发行的，或许连则子她们也不太了解。不过，这首歌现在依然很受欢迎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "07f2dd1167ae498b035df29a32f1f7457de90a6bcb049b833e8da50846d18246", "ja": "クールでダンサブルな曲で、\nリリースした時はかなり話題になったの。", "zh": "是首又酷又有舞蹈感的歌，发行时可是引起了相当大的话题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "d1dcdf3fda49089fc8b66af805fc5ec7c82fa612a3a1c455ab88bd5c56075d67", "ja": "つまり、我那覇さんの名曲を、劇場で初披露……。\n必見の公演になりそうです。……目がらんらん。", "zh": "也就是说，要在剧场首次演出我那霸小姐的名曲……\n看来会是一场绝对不能错过的公演……眼睛都亮晶晶的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "eaab07c17a06f1a72c7902239e1d4a41284786747fe6f69bf4adfd855b5b6a4e", "ja": "やりたい！　自分、絶対にやりたいぞ！\n次は『Next Life』公演で決まりさー！", "zh": "想做！我绝对想做！  \n下次就决定是《Next Life》公演啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1018_p", "source_sha256": "9247749f4c6f99f1c96cb5b474b8fe060b7c0566501ea7f11490e91c6eacdd68", "ja": "よかった。サポートメンバーは律子と……せっかく\nだから、ここにいるメンバーにお願いしようかな。", "zh": "太好了。支援成员就由律子和……难得有这个机会，就拜托在场的成员吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1019_p", "source_sha256": "ce018da2507d708b13a1438caa598586ebe08c23c723cd80409b93b172749a0d", "ja": "当然ダンスは激しくダンサブルだから、\n無理にとは言わないけど……。", "zh": "舞蹈当然会非常激烈、很有动感，\n所以我也不勉强你们就是了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "ee2aa1f6ce42b0e3b314c01474327f8d70284a6b3e4b35ca8292319c7b115689", "ja": "やるっ、無理でもやるっ！\n響についてくのは絶対大変だけど、頑張るから！", "zh": "我来！就算勉强我也要来！\n要跟上响绝对超辛苦的，但我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1021_024ann", "source_sha256": "453c510c2698b02ddc061ac71743c80ccb1236b060c6d3f4da9c40f524372208", "ja": "杏奈も……！　響さんと、ダンサブル……\n挑戦したい、ですっ。", "zh": "杏奈也……！想和响小姐一起，挑战动感舞蹈……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "6664816c9b7ce5496a85819eb7d65f67c9509b58522f92b1fc60c7b84f9218ce", "ja": "流れ的に言うまでもありませんが、私もです。\nダンサブル瑞希……、イッツ・ショウタイム。", "zh": "按这个发展，不用说，我也是。\n舞动瑞希……现在是表演时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1023_013hib", "source_sha256": "c179da609f24373f4964f319706ffc2e99b5731f071dcdd9113fc46df4dccbea", "ja": "みんな、ありがとー！\n力を合わせて、すごいステージにするさー！", "zh": "大家，谢谢你们——！\n我们要齐心协力，呈现出一场超棒的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1024_013hib", "source_sha256": "1c4b61b8e65baa227a116a85d48b3c459291e44af6d80a96bdea4615ccbf81cd", "ja": "というわけで{$P$}、任せて！\n……あ、ちゃんと無理しない範囲で頑張るぞっ。", "zh": "所以说就交给我吧，{$P$}！\n……啊，当然会在不勉强自己的范围内加油的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1025_p", "source_sha256": "59937deeaa78ca6b05dd5ba161236c8646256193a05a830e31e367e6e5697fc9", "ja": "そうだな、頼んだぞ。それじゃ早速だけど、\nレッスンのスケジュールについて相談させてくれ。", "zh": "是啊，那就拜托你了。那么事不宜迟，\n先来商量一下课程安排吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1026_013hib", "source_sha256": "197dd5b447b3aac2e0f113b3d82354bbf30a0ce9230e44e180baeb084bad9b82", "ja": "うん、わかった！　\n……あ、杏奈。宿題はその後でもいい？", "zh": "嗯，知道了！\n……啊，杏奈，作业晚点再做也可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1027_024ann", "source_sha256": "87f883574d59cb388c45ddc6d5e07a826bdfc8868585a75c4c0277043619d4a2", "ja": "え……。でも、響さん、\nこれから忙しく……なるんじゃ……。", "zh": "诶……可是，响姐，\n接下来不是会变得……很忙吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1028_013hib", "source_sha256": "38e3419f4e4885e25dfa56f5652560c45f0a9d1d319dc96deb201999d561bb38", "ja": "これくらいへっちゃらさー。それに、任せてって\n言ったからね！　約束は守らなくちゃ。", "zh": "这点小事难不倒我啦——而且，我都说了交给我嘛！约定就一定要遵守。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1029_024ann", "source_sha256": "38ddae25bb5b3a61be970c0f550bdff4dc499e6694e9e83930d7b653caa3779d", "ja": "……。ありがと、です……♪", "zh": "……。谢谢，你……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_148_1030_p", "source_sha256": "05fb0b2b7dcf0404522f02ccb88b9f0c28d1dd0b8fc57612904c12d8004dfa0d", "ja": "（ちゃんと周りも見えているし、大丈夫そうだな。\nこっちも、響をしっかりサポートしよう！）", "zh": "（也能好好观察周围，看起来没问题。我们这边也要好好支持响才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
